Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.RecurrentNumData
Column name: Chromosome Type: STRING Description: number between 1 and 48
Column name: Abnormality Type: STRING Description: abnormality description, eg '-22', or '-X', or '+15', etc
Column name: Morph Type: STRING Description: morphology code, eg '3111'
Column name: Topo Type: STRING Description: topography code, eg '0902' (or blank)
Column name: TotalCases Type: STRING Description: total number of cases (up to 2211)
Column name: ChrOrder Type: INT64 Description: numeric order of the chromosome
Sample rows:
[{'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1101', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '182', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1104', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '37', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1107', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '32', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1112', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '37', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1202', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '36', 'ChrOrder': 1}]

